{
  "schema": "pika-telemetry-vectors/1",
  "note": "Behaviour of Telemetry.event shared by the firmware host test (head_esp32/test/host/game_tel/run_tests.py) and tools/smoke_stub.lua. Times are milliseconds on the engine clock. Field types: int, bool (sent as 0/1), num (Lua float, rounded half away from zero), str, strhex (raw bytes given as hex, for invalid UTF-8; c_only), bad (unsupported Lua type). 'fail' records a reason before fields (e.g. fields or opts not a table). A step with 'c_only' cannot be produced from Lua and is skipped by the stub check. Every 'send' is also checked to parse as JSON and to fit 511 bytes.",
  "vectors": [
    {
      "name": "basic_send",
      "steps": [
        {"op": "begin", "id": "math_quiz", "trigger": "menu", "pv": "1.0.0"},
        {"op": "start", "t": 1000, "flush": []},
        {"op": "event", "t": 1500, "name": "answer", "fields": [["q", "int", 3], ["correct", "bool", true], ["choice", "str", "b"]],
         "expect": "send",
         "json": "{\"key\":\"game.tel\",\"level\":\"INFO\",\"data\":{\"id\":\"math_quiz\",\"trigger\":\"menu\",\"t_ms\":500,\"pv\":\"1.0.0\",\"ev\":\"answer\",\"q\":3,\"correct\":1,\"choice\":\"b\"}}"},
        {"op": "stats", "sent": 1, "dropped": 0, "opt_unknown": 0}
      ]
    },
